    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέτασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>curtain, veil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.111.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v/vi A. D.)</span>; esp. <i>the veil of the Temple</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				26.31
			</span></i>, Aristeas<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.51
			</span></i>, etc.; prop. <i>the inner veil</i>, the outer being
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κάλυμμα</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.148
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δόξης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.270
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τραπέζης</span> table-<i>cover,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Michel
				832.25
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>).</div>
